{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#card-zh","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"minecraft-native-mcp 是把 Minecraft Java 游戏接入 DSH 的插件，提供网页控制台和 MCP 工具。它在 DSH 页面加入启动入口，并管理本地游戏控制台；模型可读取游戏状态、空间与背包，探索、挖掘、建造和战斗，也可按需查看游戏截图。适合希望让 DSH 智能体在本机 Minecraft 世界中自主行动或从兼容 MCP 客户端调用游戏操作的用户。DSH 自主游玩需配置 DeepSeek 凭据，并需要 Windows、Java 版 Minecraft 和联网准备游戏依赖。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.mjs:1","dsh/manager.mjs:31","src/mcp-server.mjs:14","src/client-actions.mjs:1","src/deepseek.mjs:11"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#card-en","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"minecraft-native-mcp connects Minecraft Java to DSH through a web launcher and MCP tools. Agents inspect the world and inventory, then explore, mine, build, fight or request screenshots. Autonomous play needs a DeepSeek key, Windows, Minecraft Java and network access for setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.mjs:1","dsh/manager.mjs:31","src/mcp-server.mjs:14","src/client-actions.mjs:1","src/deepseek.mjs:11"]}
