{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#feature-1","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"minecraft-native-mcp 的功能「Minecraft 游戏控制台」：在 DSH 页面打开本地控制台，并查看准备和运行状态；用户可准备依赖、打开控制台或保存并停止插件启动的实例。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.mjs:4","dsh/manager.mjs:31"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#feature-2","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"minecraft-native-mcp 的功能「游戏 MCP 工具」：通过 stdio MCP 暴露游戏操作，客户端可读取状态、背包和方块信息并执行游戏动作，结果以文本返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp-server.mjs:14","src/mcp-server.mjs:24","src/client-actions.mjs:1"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#feature-3","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"minecraft-native-mcp 的功能「游戏画面检查」：调用 inspect_game_screen 请求当前游戏截图并返回图片供模型观察；调用需说明观察原因，成功截图之间至少间隔 15 秒。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/vision.mjs:4","src/mcp-server.mjs:29"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#caveat-1","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"minecraft-native-mcp 的 DSH 自主游玩循环会调用 DeepSeek API，并读取 DSH 中的 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 凭据；通用 MCP 以 --launch 启动时不要求该密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/deepseek.mjs:11","src/mcp-server.mjs:14"]}
{"unit_id":"tianyingAquila__minecraft-native-mcp#caveat-2","repo":"tianyingAquila/minecraft-native-mcp","commit":"111491b41ba63bc793c84ef001ddab237d630682","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"minecraft-native-mcp 的启动器将控制台工作文件、设置和日志写入工作目录，并通过 PowerShell 准备运行依赖；项目说明当前支持 Windows x64。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/manager.mjs:31","dsh/manager.mjs:44","README.md:1"]}
